  "description": "Radical Rick! The coolest comic character in BMX history--In collaboration with renowned BMX comic artist Damian Fulton, the Radical Rick big bike collection features exclusive hand-drawn Radical Rick graphics, along with a custom RR pad set and number plate. All this art on a heat treated aluminum frame, chromoly fork and cranks, with sealed bearings, a rear disc brake for wheelie control, and a padded, railed Radical Rick seat. Everything you need to take on MX Mug. Available in 24, 26 and 29-inch wheel sizes.\n6061-T6 heat-treated alloy frame. Integrated head tube w/gusset. Mid BB shell. Disc brake mounts.\n1 1/8\" threadless full chromoly fork w/internally threaded steerer tube & tapered legs\nHaro Baseline 3-piece chromoly cranks. 8-spline spindle. 175mm.\nHaro alloy sprocket. 39T.\nRadius mechanical disc brake w/160mm rotor\nAlloy double-wall rims, 36 hole.\nHaro Radical Rick railed seat.\nHaro Baseline top load stem\nRadical Rick pad set and number plate included.",
